  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 26 November 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nImagine starting your mornings with an easy walk to Browns Bay School, knowing your children are also within the highly sought-after Rangitoto College zone. Just moments from the sand and surf, this modern family home offers the perfect blend of quality education, coastal living, and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover a bright, welcoming sanctuary designed for growing and extended families. Built by the owners with their own family living in mind, this home reflects a thoughtful approach to quality, comfort, and functionality.Boasting five generous bedrooms, including two luxurious ensuites, and four and a half bathrooms, there is plenty of room for everyone to enjoy their own space.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled open-plan living areas flow seamlessly to the outdoors, creating the perfect setting for morning coffees, relaxed family gatherings, and alfresco dining in the fresh sea air. A double garage, built-in storage, and a freehold section of approximately 412m² provide excellent practicality without compromising on style.\r\n\r\nWith Browns Bay School within walking distance and the beach just a short stroll away, weekends here are all about sandy feet, ice creams along the boardwalk, and enjoying the vibrant cafés and restaurants of Browns Bay. Embrace the relaxed East Coast Bays lifestyle all year round.\r\n\r\nZoned for Rangitoto College , Browns Bay School and Murrays Bay & Northross Intermediate, with walking distance to Browns Bay Primary School. \r\nWe invite you to arrange a private viewing or join us at the open home to experience this exceptional lifestyle for yourself.",
